## 9. Decision Algorithm (Simplified)

```
Elevated ICP in TBI (>22 mmHg)
        ↓
First-line hyperosmolar therapy
        ↓
┌──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┐
│ Hemodynamically      │ Hemodynamically      │
│ unstable / hypotensive│ stable / hypertensive│
│ or AKI risk          │ or hypernatremic     │
└──────────┬───────────┴──────────┬───────────┘
           ↓                      ↓
     Hypertonic Saline        Mannitol
     (3% bolus or infusion)   (0.25–1 g/kg)
           ↓                      ↓
   Monitor Na⁺, volume,     Monitor osmolality,
   acid-base, ICP           creatinine, urine output
           ↓                      ↓
   Refractory ICP? → Consider alternating/combination therapy
```


